     A                                      COLHDG('Maintenance Time')
     A            AIIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial User')
     A            AIIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      TEXT('Initial Pgm')
     A            AIIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Date')
     A            AIITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('Initial Time')
